## Current Bottleneck

The current `eval_sequences` function is non-overlapping windowed causal evaluation. It scores each frame once, but resets temporal history at artificial clip boundaries. The final requested evaluation requires proper causal streaming/sliding evaluation. This is the main code gap before final matrix reporting.

Training is also evaluation-heavy. The 100-step A timing run reported:

```text
